"A separate Media Library review asset is ready. The source image and "
"published page remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Assi separat għar-reviżjoni tal-Media Library huwa lest. L-immaġni tas-sors"
" u l-paġna ppubblikata jibqgħu l-verżjoni awtorevoli."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-site-plan.php:69
msgid ""
"A site translation plan needs one source locale and at least one different "
"target locale."
msgstr ""
"Pjan għat-traduzzjoni tas-sit jeħtieġ lokalizzazzjoni tas-sors waħda u "
"mill-inqas lokalizzazzjoni fil-mira differenti."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin-terms.php:125
