"L-ispazju tax-xogħol konness bħalissa juri mudell wieħed jew inqas. Aġġorna"
" l-kont u ivverifika d-drittijiet tal-pjan jekk tistenna katalgu usa'."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin.php:955
msgid "The enabled-locale order now drives YMulti frontend switchers and dropdowns."
msgstr ""
"L-ordni tal-lokalizzazzjonijiet attivati issa tikkontrolla s-seletturi u "
"l-listi tal-frontend ta' YMulti."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:2215
msgid ""
"The encryption method used for the stored API key is unavailable. Reconnect"
