msgstr ""
"Il-metodu tal-kriptaġġ użat għaċ-ċavetta API maħżuna mhuwiex disponibbli. "
"Erġa' qabbad il-kont."

#: includes/class-ypm-integrity-audit.php:88
msgid ""
"The export contains IDs, taxonomy/post-type names and consistency states. "
"API keys and AI credentials stay in protected settings."
msgstr ""
"L-esportazzjoni tinkludi IDs, ismijiet tat-tassonomiji u tipi ta' "
"postijiet, u stati ta' konsistenza. Iċ-ċwievet API u l-kredenzjali tal-AI "
"jibqgħu f'settings protetti."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1632
msgid "The final AI document requires translated content."
msgstr "Id-dokument finali tal-AI jeħtieġ kontenut tradott."

#: includes/class-ypm-media-localization.php:321
msgid "The generated image URL requires a safe HTTPS URL."
msgstr "Il-URL tal-immaġni ġġenerata jrid ikun URL HTTPS sigur."

#: includes/class-ypm-media-localization.php:341
msgid ""
"The generated image did not pass Media Library validation. Choose another "
"image model or revise the generation request, then try again."
msgstr ""
"L-immaġni ġġenerata ma għaddietx il-verifika tal-Media Library. Agħżel "
"mudell ta' immaġni ieħor jew irrevedi t-talba għall-ġenerazzjoni, imbagħad "
"erġa' pprova."

#: includes/class-ypm-translation-glossary.php:71
msgid ""
"The glossary guides future AI output while existing human translations "
"remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Il-glossarju jiggwida l-output futur tal-AI filwaqt li t-traduzzjonijiet "
"umani eżistenti jibqgħu l-awtorità."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-admin.php:87
msgid ""
"The key travels only to ai.yablonsky.io, is stored encrypted with this "
"WordPress installation's keys, and appears as a masked value after saving. "
"Local multilingual features remain independent of AI."
msgstr ""
"Iċ-ċavetta tintbagħat biss lil ai.yablonsky.io, tinħażen ikkriptata "
"biċ-ċwievet ta' din l-installazzjoni ta' WordPress, u tidher moħbija wara "
"s-sejvjar. Il-funzjonijiet multilingwi lokali jibqgħu indipendenti mill-AI."

#: includes/class-ymulti-autopilot.php:768
msgid ""
"The launch plan summarizes the active scope. Save keeps the configuration "
"ready for later; Launch stores the plan, scans the current scope, prepares "
"the backlog and starts continuous background processing."
msgstr ""
"Il-pjan tat-tnedija jiġbor fil-qosor l-ambitu attiv. Issejvja jżomm il-"
"konfigurazzjoni għal aktar tard; Niedi jaħżen il-pjan, jiskennja l-ambitu "
"attwali, iħejji l-lista tal-pendenti u jibda l-ipproċessar kontinwu fl-"
"isfond."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:908
msgid "The local image file path requires a readable WordPress attachment."
msgstr ""
"Il-mogħdija tal-fajl lokali tal-immaġni teħtieġ fajl mehmuż ta' WordPress "
"li jista' jinqara."

#: includes/compat/class-ypm-compat-woo.php:213
msgid ""
"The locale dictionary will be reused from request memory after its first "
"load."
msgstr ""
"Id-dizzjunarju tal-lokalizzazzjoni jerġa' jintuża mill-memorja tat-talba "
"wara l-ewwel tagħbija tiegħu."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:193
msgid ""
"The localized page changed the protected HTML/JavaScript/CSS structure. "
"YMulti rejected the draft and preserved the source structure."
msgstr ""
"Il-paġna lokalizzata bidlet l-istruttura protetta HTML/JavaScript/CSS. "
"YMulti ċaħad l-abbozz u żamm l-istruttura tas-sors."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1328
msgid ""
"The localized response changed content outside detected human-language "
"regions. YMulti rejected the draft and preserved the source structure."
msgstr ""
"It-tweġiba lokalizzata bidlet kontenut barra ż-żoni identifikati tal-lingwa"
" umana. YMulti ċaħad l-abbozz u żamm l-istruttura tas-sors."

#: includes/compat/class-ypm-compat-woo.php:318
msgid ""
"The native WooCommerce translation remains active until you save an "
"override."
msgstr ""
"It-traduzzjoni nattiva ta' WooCommerce tibqa' attiva sakemm tissejvja "
"eċċezzjoni."

#: includes/class-ymulti-localized-bases.php:167
msgid ""
"The native WordPress rewrite base stays active for locales with a blank "
"field. Localization applies to public content routes, while wp-admin, REST "
"and system paths keep their native paths."
msgstr ""
"Il-bażi nattiva tar-regoli tal-URL ta' WordPress tibqa' attiva għal-"
"lokalizzazzjonijiet b'qasam vojt. Il-lokalizzazzjoni tapplika għar-rotot "
"pubbliċi tal-kontenut, filwaqt li wp-admin, REST u t-toroq tas-sistema "
"jżommu r-rotot nattivi tagħhom."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin-terms.php:67
msgid ""
"The new term remains an independent WordPress taxonomy object for this "
"locale."
msgstr ""
"It-terminu l-ġdid jibqa' oġġett indipendenti tat-tassonomija WordPress għal"
" din il-lokalizzazzjoni."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1244
msgid "The next translation stage is ready when the AI safety budget refreshes."
msgstr ""
"L-istadju tat-traduzzjoni li jmiss ikun lest meta jerġa' jimtela l-baġit "
"tas-sigurtà tal-AI."

#: includes/compat/class-ypm-compat-woo.php:300
msgid ""
"The original WooCommerce attribute label remains active until you save a "
"localized override."
msgstr ""
"It-tikketta oriġinali tal-attribut WooCommerce tibqa' attiva sakemm "
"tissejvja eċċezzjoni lokalizzata."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-admin.php:190
msgid ""
"The selected route must be enabled by the workspace plan before the canary "
"can run."
msgstr ""
"Ir-rotta magħżula trid tkun attivata mill-pjan tal-ispazju tax-xogħol qabel"
" it-test dirett."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1677
msgid ""
"The selected text model stream ended before a usable message response "
"arrived. WordPress content remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Il-fluss tal-mudell tat-test magħżul intemm qabel waslet tweġiba ta' "
"messaġġ li tista' tintuża. Il-kontenut WordPress baqa' mhux mibdul."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:74
msgid ""
"The source HTML contains an unterminated script or style element. Complete "
"the markup, then start AI translation."
msgstr ""
"L-HTML tas-sors fih element script jew style li mhux magħluq. Imla "
"l-markup, imbagħad ibda t-traduzzjoni bl-AI."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:46
msgid ""
"The source HTML contains an unterminated tag or quoted attribute. Complete "
"the markup, then start AI translation."
msgstr ""
"L-HTML tas-sors fih tag mhux magħluq jew attribut f'virgoletti mhux "
"magħluq. Imla l-markup, imbagħad ibda t-traduzzjoni bl-AI."

#: includes/class-ymulti-xliff-exchange.php:94
msgid ""
"The source changed after this XLIFF package was created. Export a fresh "
"package before importing to prevent stale translations from overwriting "
"newer source content."
msgstr ""
"Is-sors inbidel wara li nħoloq dan il-pakkett XLIFF. Esporta pakkett ġdid "
"qabel timporta biex tevita li traduzzjonijiet skaduti jissostitwixxu "
"kontenut tas-sors aktar ġdid."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:116
msgid ""
"The source contains overlapping localization regions. AI translation was "
"stopped to protect the page structure."
msgstr ""
"Is-sors fih żoni ta' lokalizzazzjoni li jirkbu fuq xulxin. It-traduzzjoni "
"bl-AI twaqqfet biex titħares l-istruttura tal-paġna."

#: includes/class-ymulti-translation-freshness.php:57
msgid "The source content still matches the baseline used by this translation."
msgstr "Il-kontenut tas-sors għadu jaqbel mal-bażi użata minn din it-traduzzjoni."

#: includes/class-ypm-media-localization.php:268
msgid ""
"The source image changed after Vision review. Run the review again before "
"generating a localized candidate."
msgstr ""
"L-immaġni tas-sors inbidlet wara r-reviżjoni Vision. Erġa' wettaq ir-"
"reviżjoni qabel tiġġenera kandidat lokalizzat."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin-terms.php:515
msgid ""
"The source parent translation is ready to add for this locale. The new term"
" starts at the taxonomy root and can be re-parented later."
msgstr ""
"It-traduzzjoni tat-terminu ġenitur hija lesta biex tiżdied għal din il-"
"lokalizzazzjoni. It-terminu l-ġdid jibda fl-għerq tat-tassonomija u jista' "
"jingħata ġenitur aktar tard."

#: includes/compat/class-ypm-woo-order-language.php:422
msgid ""
"The source plugin setting remains active until you save an override. "
"Overrides apply when the email carries an order with this YMulti locale."
msgstr ""
"L-issettjar tal-plugin tas-sors jibqa' attiv sakemm tissejvja eċċezzjoni. "
"L-eċċezzjonijiet japplikaw meta l-email ikun marbut ma' ordni b'din il-"
"lokalizzazzjoni YMulti."

#: includes/class-ymulti-translation-freshness.php:58
msgid ""
"The source title, excerpt or content changed after this translation was "
"last saved. Review before treating it as current."
msgstr ""
"It-titlu, is-silta jew il-kontenut tas-sors inbidel minn meta din it-"
"traduzzjoni ġiet issejvjata l-aħħar. Irrevedi qabel tqisha aġġornata."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin.php:863
msgid "The spare workspace slot becomes a calm teaser with a clear next action."
msgstr ""
"Il-post żejjed fl-ispazju tax-xogħol isir previżjoni sempliċi b'azzjoni "
"ċara li jmiss."

#: yablonsky-multilingual.php:179
msgid ""
"The superseded development package is inactive. It can be removed from "
"Installed Plugins; Yablonsky Multilingual keeps the existing multilingual "
"settings and translation data."
msgstr ""
"Il-pakkett tal-iżvilupp li ġie sostitwit huwa inattiv. Jista' jitneħħa minn"
" Plugins Installati; Yablonsky Multilingual iżomm l-issettjar multilingwi u"
" d-dejta tat-traduzzjoni eżistenti."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:331
msgid ""
"The title/excerpt metadata is too large for a bounded translation stage. "
"Shorten the source metadata first."
msgstr ""
"Il-metadejta tat-titlu/silta hija kbira wisq għal stadju limitat tat-"
"traduzzjoni. L-ewwel qassar il-metadejta tas-sors."

#: includes/class-ymulti-xliff-exchange.php:304
msgid ""
"The translated excerpt is missing from the XLIFF file. Complete the excerpt"
" unit, then import the package again."
msgstr ""
"Is-silta tradotta hija nieqsa mill-fajl XLIFF. Imla l-unità tas-silta, "
"imbagħad erġa' importa l-pakkett."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin-terms.php:662
msgid ""
"The translation link has expired. Return to the taxonomy screen and try "
